  "releaseNotes": "0.7.13 makes film negatives automatic: FindFilmFrame finds a 35 mm frame from its perforation, and DevelopNegative straightens and crops it, takes the film base from the rebate and evens out the backlight (NegativeOptions.Frame, Crop, CorrectIllumination; warnings BacklightTexture, FrameCut, UnevenIllumination). On a photograph with perforation DevelopNegative now returns the cropped frame. Bicubic rotation is vectorized and parallel with identical pixels. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp/blob/v0.7.13/docs/releases/release-0.7.13.md",
